{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1559","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔噫吁嚱（yīxūxī）〕三个字都是叹词。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔蚕丛及鱼凫〕蚕丛、鱼凫，传说中古蜀王名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔茫然〕模糊难知的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔尔来〕从那时以来，指古蜀国开国以来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔秦塞〕秦地的关塞。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔西当太白有鸟道〕意思是，秦地西面有太白山阻隔了入蜀之路，山势高峻，道路狭窄，只有鸟才能飞过。鸟道，人兽皆不能至的险峻狭窄山路。当，正对着。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔横绝〕横越，飞越。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔地崩山摧壮士死〕相传秦惠王想征服蜀国，知道蜀王好色，答应送给他五个美女。蜀王派五个力士迎接。返回时路经梓潼（今四川剑阁南），看见一条大蛇钻入穴中，五个力士用力往外拽。结果，山崩地裂，力士和女子全被压死，山分为五岭，入蜀之路遂通。摧，毁坏，这里指崩塌。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔天梯石栈〕天梯，指高险的山路。一说指木制的栈道。石栈，俗称“栈道”，在山崖上凿石架木建成的通道。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔六龙回日之高标〕迫使太阳神的车驾回转的高峻的山峰。六龙，传说太阳神的车由六条龙拉着，羲和是其御者。回，回转。高标，指高耸的山峰。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔冲波逆折之回川〕激浪冲撞岩石倒流形成的回旋急流。冲波，激浪。逆折，倒流。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔黄鹤〕即黄鹄，善高飞的大鸟。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔猱（náo）〕猿的一种，善攀援。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔青泥〕指青泥岭，在今甘肃徽县境内，是由秦入蜀的要道。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔盘盘〕盘旋曲折的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔扪（mén）参（shēn）历井〕意思是，山高入天，由秦入蜀的人在山上，可以用手触摸到星宿，甚至可以从中穿过。参、井，星宿名，二者邻近，分别是蜀和秦的分野（古人把地域与星宿分别对应，称为分野）。扪，摸。历，穿越。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔仰胁息〕仰着头，屏住呼吸。胁息，屏住呼吸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔坐〕空，徒然。一说坐下来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔西游〕指入蜀。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔巉（chán）岩〕高而险的山岩。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔凋朱颜〕使容颜大变。凋，用作使动，使……凋谢。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔飞湍〕急流。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔喧豗（huī）〕形容轰响。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔砯（pīng）崖转石万壑雷〕（急流和瀑布）冲击山崖，使大石滚动而下，千山万壑间响起雷鸣般的声音。砯，水冲击石壁发出的响声，这里用作动词，“冲击”的意思。转，使滚动。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔嗟尔远道之人胡为乎来哉〕啊！你这远方的人为什么要来这里呢？嗟，叹词。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔剑阁〕指今四川剑阁北的大剑山和小剑山，群峰如剑插天，两山如门，极为险要。山间有栈道，即剑阁道，为诸葛亮所开辟，是秦、蜀两地间要道。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔一夫当关，万夫莫开〕形容剑阁易守难攻。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-27"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔所守或匪亲，化为狼与豺〕守关的将领倘若不是（自己的）亲信，就会变成叛乱者。此句与上句语本西晋张载《剑阁铭》：“一夫荷戟，万夫趑趄（zī jū）。形胜之地，匪亲勿居。”狼与豺，比喻叛乱为害的人。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-28"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔咨嗟〕叹息。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10423-29"}],"blocks":[{"type":"divider"},{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"噫吁嚱","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10423-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，危乎高哉！蜀道之难，难于上青天！蚕丛及鱼凫","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10423-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，开国何茫然","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10423-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！尔来","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10423-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"四万八千岁，不与秦塞","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10423-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"通人烟。西当太白有鸟道","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-10423-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，可以横绝","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-10423-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"峨眉巅。地崩山摧壮士死","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10423-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，然后天梯石栈","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10423-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"相钩连。上有六龙回日之高标","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-10423-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，下有冲波逆折之回川","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-10423-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。黄鹤","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-10423-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之飞尚不得过，猿猱","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-10423-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"欲度愁攀援。青泥","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-10423-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"何盘盘","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-10423-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，百步九折萦岩峦。扪参历井","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-10423-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"仰胁息","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-10423-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，以手抚膺坐","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-10423-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"长叹。","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"问君西游","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-10423-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"何时还？畏途巉岩","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-10423-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不可攀。但见悲鸟号古木，雄飞雌从绕林间。又闻子规啼夜月，愁空山。蜀道之难，难于上青天，使人听此凋朱颜","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-10423-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！连峰去天不盈尺，枯松倒挂倚绝壁。飞湍","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-10423-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"瀑流争喧豗","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-10423-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，砯崖转石万壑雷","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-10423-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。其险也如此，嗟尔远道之人胡为乎来哉","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-10423-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"剑阁","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-10423-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"峥嵘而崔嵬，一夫当关，万夫莫开","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-10423-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。所守或匪亲，化为狼与豺","type":"text"},{"label":"[28]","noteId":"footnote-10423-28","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。朝避猛虎，夕避长蛇，磨牙吮血，杀人如麻。锦城虽云乐，不如早还家。蜀道之难，难于上青天，侧身西望长咨嗟","type":"text"},{"label":"[29]","noteId":"footnote-10423-29","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"runs":[{"text":"蜀道难图 ［元］赵孟頫作","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《李白集校注》卷三（上海古籍出版社1980年版）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"这首诗一般认为作于唐天宝初年，是诗人在长安时为送别友人入蜀而作。蜀道难，古乐府旧题。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"蜀道，指陝西入四川的古棧道。《蜀道難》是樂府《相和歌辭‧瑟調曲》的舊題，多以蜀道的艱險難行作為題材。而樂府的《蜀道難》是由更古的《行路難》演變而來。對於李白《蜀道難》的寫作年代，有著不同的說法。多認為這首詩是作於天寶二年。至於《蜀道難》的寓意，歷來眾說紛紜，詹鉠綜合為四說：一是罪嚴武；二是刺章仇兼瓊；三是勸阻玄宗幸蜀；四是即事成篇，別無寓意。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/3-%e8%9c%80%e9%81%93%e9%9a%be-%e6%9d%8e%e7%99%bd","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/3-%e8%9c%80%e9%81%93%e9%9a%be-%e6%9d%8e%e7%99%bd","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83/3-%e8%9c%80%e9%81%93%e9%9a%be-%e6%9d%8e%e7%99%bd","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":106097,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/96d77795956a8f8aac6cb6453a9c690f91dbb749.jpeg","height":862,"id":"media-b78a9ad1e8dfba9ae853","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"5824debb0ef47c6794601eef2ec0ea39f3794d3e1c41b98a5b534888901bbc59","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/9/96d77795956a8f8aac6cb6453a9c690f91dbb749.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":328}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10423,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10423-h-123456789101112131415161718-1","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-10423-h-123456789101112131415161718-1","text":"#p-10423-h--1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-1","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-2","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-3","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-4","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-5","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-6","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-7","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-8","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-9","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-10","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-10","text":"[10]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-11","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-11","text":"[11]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10423-12","postId":10423,"postNumber":1,